    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think a counselor can change the fact that i'm just a coward at my core. everything i do feels like a performance. i look at people who are actually kind and i just feel like a parasite or something. like i'm just existing while everyone else actually contributes. i don't see how i'm supposed to just carry this around forever when it feels like my very presence is a mistake.",
